## Dispatch and Boolean work

P13 preserves the frozen policy exactly: **5/36** Gate-P cases annotate and all **5** consume a fold. Boolean work is therefore unchanged from P8-P12:

- multiplications: **0.812451x direct**;
- pair terms: **0.570459x direct**;
- peak monomials: **0.978577x direct**;
- ANF nodes evaluated: **0.873553x direct**.

## Memory

Gate-P whole-pipeline traced peak allocation was **0.993050x direct** and **0.978928x P12**. The list-plus-temporary-set/count design is slightly lower than P12 on the geometric-mean peak metric, but memory is not the limiting endpoint here.

