## Post-hoc diagnostic

Keeping P13's exact frozen dispatch decisions and measured compiler medians, but replacing P13 source-build+dispatch cost with ordinary direct source-build cost, gives **0.958020x direct case-balanced** and **0.872678x workload-weighted**. This remains diagnostic only.

## Predeclared outcomes

- Gate-P direct-crossover PASS: **False**.
- Deferred-pair engineering success: **False**.

P13 therefore gives a useful negative engineering result: moving exact pair counting into C-backed dispatch work is mathematically clean and decision-identical, but does **not** remove enough CPython telemetry cost to make the case-balanced source-inclusive pipeline win.
